# EZpenguin software catalog — one entry per line.
# Format: id|display name|packages (space-separated)|category|description
# Used by `ez-software` (TUI + CLI). Keep packages available in Debian.

# --- server ---
nginx|Nginx web server|nginx|server|High-performance web server + reverse proxy
lighttpd|Lighttpd web server|lighttpd|server|Lightweight web server
mariadb|MariaDB database|mariadb-server|server|Drop-in MySQL replacement
postgres|PostgreSQL database|postgresql|server|Advanced SQL database
redis|Redis|redis-server|server|In-memory data store
docker|Docker|docker.io|server|Container runtime + engine
podman|Podman|podman|server|Daemonless container engine
samba|Samba file server|samba|server|Windows-compatible file sharing
nfs|NFS server|nfs-kernel-server|server|Network file sharing (Linux)
syncthing|Syncthing|syncthing|server|Continuous file sync between devices
prometheus-node|Prometheus node exporter|prometheus-node-exporter|server|Machine metrics exporter

# --- remote access / net ---
wireguard|WireGuard VPN|wireguard-tools|network|Fast modern VPN (kernel module incl.)
tailscale|Tailscale (repo needed)|tailscale|network|Zero-config VPN (install via script)
caddy|Caddy web server|caddy|network|HTTPS-by-default web server
mosh|Mosh|mosh|network|Roaming SSH terminal
rsync-server|rsync daemon|rsync|network|Classic file sync

# --- tools / monitoring ---
cockpit|Cockpit web console|cockpit|tools|Web-based system management UI
htop-full|htop|htop|tools|Interactive process viewer
tmux|tmux|tmux|tools|Terminal multiplexer
git|Git|git|tools|Version control
neofetch|Fastfetch system info|fastfetch|tools|Pretty system summary
btop|btop++|btop|tools|Resource monitor (better htop)
ncdu|ncdu disk usage|ncdu|tools|Interactive disk usage analyzer
iperf3|iperf3|iperf3|tools|Network throughput testing

# --- desktop (optional) ---
xfce|XFCE desktop|task-xfce-desktop lightdm|desktop|Lightweight full desktop
